---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Now - Mridu">
  <article>

    <section class="intro">
      <h1>Now</h1>
      <p class="updated">Updated August 14, 2026</p>
    </section>


    <section>
      <h2>Learning</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To build an MCP server and to connect it to different AI agents (Claude.ai web, ChatGPT, etc.).</li>
      </ul>
      <h2 style="margin-top: 20px;">Courses completed in 2026</h2>
      <p class="month-label" style="margin-top: 12px;">January</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://learn.deeplearning.ai/accomplishments/59075fa0-945a-40ef-92f3-73a49db41b67" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ChatGPT Prompt Engineering for Developers ↗</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://learn.deeplearning.ai/accomplishments/6e080994-da0b-4efa-af34-8af9b4476f22" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Building Systems with the ChatGPT API ↗</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://learn.deeplearning.ai/accomplishments/380ceeb4-cb3f-44f1-b518-8d1f86af9148?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">How Transformer LLMs Work ↗</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="month-label">February</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://learn.kodekloud.com/certificate/499eae58-d864-4cae-ac8c-4057f91d1af6" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Docker Training Course for Absolute Beginners ↗</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://verify.skilljar.com/c/g3kkj8wnp7tm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Claude Code in Action ↗</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://learn.deeplearning.ai/accomplishments/5cded286-e670-4c15-afd5-033af92e42aa?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vector Databases: From Embeddings to Applications ↗</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="month-label">March</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://learn.deeplearning.ai/certificates/5d0996e3-4a19-4ce6-a23e-04ff776e1fee" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) ↗</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://anthropic.skilljar.com/introduction-to-agent-skills" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Introduction to Agent Skills ↗</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="month-label">April</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://learn.deeplearning.ai/certificates/9b11afeb-afe7-424a-9c1b-2f5dc0f26405?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Agentic AI ↗</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="month-label">July</p>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://verify.skilljar.com/c/p3f79co5sfcw" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Introduction to SubAgents ↗</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Reading</h2>
      <p>Obviously Awesome by April Dunford</p>
    </section>

  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  article {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  section p:not(.month-label), section ul {
    margin: 0;
  }

  section p:not(.month-label) + p:not(.month-label) {
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  section ul {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .intro h1 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .updated {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--fg-faint);
    margin: 0;
  }

  h2 {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  p, li {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }

  .month-label {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--fg-faint);
    margin: 24px 0 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

</style>
